  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Given below are two statements :</p><p>Statement I : The electronegativity of group <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>14</mn></math> elements from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Si</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Pb</mi></math> gradually decreases.</p><p>Statement II : Group <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>14</mn></math> contains non-metallic, metallic, as well as metalloid elements.</p><p>In the light of the above statements, choose the most appropriate from the options given below :</p>",
    "image": null
